  "vibe": "Near-black warm room (#14100e) lit only by a pulsing safelight red (#e2483d), with amber (#e89b3c) in the film frames and warm grey (#cfc9bd) type. Syne's wide geometric display over Hanken Grotesk, uppercase on every beat. The world is a working darkroom: a red bulb breathing r40±6 inside a soft 110px halo, a drying line strung across the frame with three film strips clipped to it swaying ±5°, each with sprocket holes down its edge and five amber frames inside, and a developing tray at the floor where concentric ripples expand and fade in safelight red. Cards and stat numbers actually glow. Its terminal beat runs a real console with a block caret and a green OK, and its Ring is a graduated cylinder that fills — the chemistry, not a chart. Machete titles slash in at −6° skew, cadence 7, Lively not bouncy. Best of this set for dark product UI.",
